      *>================================================================
      *> PROGRAM-ID : APSVC
      *> SYSTEM     : STERP - Stefan's ERP
      *> MODULE     : PURCHASE LEDGER (CREDITORS)
      *> PURPOSE    : THE PURCHASE LEDGER'S SITE SERVICE WRAPPER.  IT
      *>              IS THE ONLY AP PROGRAM THAT HOLDS THE COMMON
      *>              SERVICE LINKAGE AREAS, SO THE LEDGER PROGRAMS
      *>              THEMSELVES CARRY ONE COMMAREA EACH AND NEVER HAVE
      *>              TO QUALIFY A STANDARD HEADER FIELD.
      *>              NOT A LINKABLE PROGRAM - IT IS CALLED ONLY FROM
      *>              OTHER PURCHASE LEDGER MODULES.
      *> CALLED BY  : EVERY AP ONLINE AND BATCH PROGRAM
      *> INTERFACE  : CALL "APSVC" USING WS-APSVC   (COPYBOOK APSVCARE)
      *> CALLS      : PERMCHK PARMGET AUDITLOG EXCPRAIS NUMGEN PERIODCK
      *>              TERMCALC FXCONV DATECALC STRUTIL RNDALLOC IDEMPOT
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
      *> CHANGE LOG
      *> 1991-02-28 RJH  ORIGINAL - ICL SERVICE HANDLER REWRITTEN FOR
      *>                 THE MVS PORT
      *> 1996-08-05 DJM  CR0655 EXCEPTION RAISING ADDED
      *> 1999-11-30 KMP  Y2K - 4 DIGIT YEARS
      *> 2026-10-05 STERP MAPPED ONTO THE STERP COMMON SERVICES
      *> 2026-10-07 STERP TERMS CALLED TERMCALC WITH THE BASIS NAME
      *>                 INVOICE INSTEAD OF THE FUNCTION DUEDATE, SO
      *>                 NO DUE OR DISCOUNT DATE EVER CAME BACK;
      *>                 FXREAL PUT THE BOOKED RATE IN THE ENTERED
      *>                 QUOTATION INSTEAD OF FX-RATE, SO FXCONV SAW
      *>                 NO RATE AT ALL AND REFUSED EVERY CALL
      *>================================================================
      *> REQ: COM-002, COM-005, COM-009, COM-011, COM-013, COM-017
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. APSVC.
       AUTHOR. R J HOLDEN.
       DATE-WRITTEN. 28/02/1991.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-PC.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-PC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY PERMCHKCA REPLACING ==DFHCOMMAREA== BY ==WS-PERM-CA==.
       COPY PARMGETCA REPLACING ==DFHCOMMAREA== BY ==WS-PARM-CA==.
       COPY AUDITLOGCA REPLACING ==DFHCOMMAREA== BY ==WS-AUD-CA==.
       COPY EXCPRAISCA REPLACING ==DFHCOMMAREA== BY ==WS-EXC-CA==.
       COPY NUMGENCA REPLACING ==DFHCOMMAREA== BY ==WS-NUM-CA==.
       COPY PERIODCKCA REPLACING ==DFHCOMMAREA== BY ==WS-PER-CA==.
       COPY TERMCALCCA REPLACING ==DFHCOMMAREA== BY ==WS-TRM-CA==.
       COPY FXCONVCA REPLACING ==DFHCOMMAREA== BY ==WS-FXC-CA==.
       COPY DATECALCCA REPLACING ==DFHCOMMAREA== BY ==WS-DAT-CA==.
       COPY STRUTILCA REPLACING ==DFHCOMMAREA== BY ==WS-STR-CA==.
       COPY RNDALLOCCA REPLACING ==DFHCOMMAREA== BY ==WS-RND-CA==.
       COPY IDEMPOTCA REPLACING ==DFHCOMMAREA== BY ==WS-IDM-CA==.
       01  WS-LOCAL.
           05  WS-RC                   PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
           05  WS-WORK-NUM             PIC S9(15)V9(6) VALUE 0.
           05  WS-NUM-EDIT             PIC -(13)9.9(6).
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       COPY APSVCARE.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING WS-APSVC.
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE SECTION.
       0000-START.
           MOVE 0 TO SVC-RC
           MOVE SPACES TO SVC-REASON SVC-MESSAGE
           EVALUATE SVC-FUNC
               WHEN "PERM"     PERFORM 1000-PERM THRU 1000-EXIT
               WHEN "PARMNUM"  PERFORM 1100-PARM THRU 1100-EXIT
               WHEN "PARMTXT"  PERFORM 1100-PARM THRU 1100-EXIT
               WHEN "AUDIT"    PERFORM 1200-AUDIT THRU 1200-EXIT
               WHEN "EXCEPT"   PERFORM 1300-EXCEPT THRU 1300-EXIT
               WHEN "NUMBER"   PERFORM 1400-NUMBER THRU 1400-EXIT
               WHEN "PERIOD"   PERFORM 1500-PERIOD THRU 1500-EXIT
               WHEN "TERMS"    PERFORM 1600-TERMS THRU 1600-EXIT
               WHEN "FXTOGBP"  PERFORM 1700-FXGBP THRU 1700-EXIT
               WHEN "FXREAL"   PERFORM 1800-FXREAL THRU 1800-EXIT
               WHEN "NORMREF"  PERFORM 1900-NORMREF THRU 1900-EXIT
               WHEN "ROUND"    PERFORM 2000-ROUND THRU 2000-EXIT
               WHEN "ADDDAYS"  PERFORM 2100-DATES THRU 2100-EXIT
               WHEN "DAYSBTWN" PERFORM 2100-DATES THRU 2100-EXIT
               WHEN "BUSDAY"   PERFORM 2100-DATES THRU 2100-EXIT
               WHEN "ADJUST"   PERFORM 2100-DATES THRU 2100-EXIT
               WHEN "ADDBUS"   PERFORM 2100-DATES THRU 2100-EXIT
               WHEN "ADDMONTH" PERFORM 2100-DATES THRU 2100-EXIT
               WHEN "IDEMBEG"  PERFORM 2200-IDEM THRU 2200-EXIT
               WHEN "IDEMEND"  PERFORM 2200-IDEM THRU 2200-EXIT
               WHEN OTHER
                   MOVE 8 TO SVC-RC
                   MOVE "APV0099" TO SVC-REASON
                   MOVE "Unsupported purchase ledger service request"
                       TO SVC-MESSAGE
           END-EVALUATE.
       0000-RETURN.
           GOBACK.
       0000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-PERM SECTION.
       1000-START.
           INITIALIZE WS-PERM-CA
           MOVE "CHECK" TO CA-FUNCTION OF WS-PERM-CA
           MOVE SVC-COMPANY TO CA-COMPANY OF WS-PERM-CA
           MOVE SVC-SITE TO CA-SITE OF WS-PERM-CA
           MOVE SVC-USER TO CA-USER OF WS-PERM-CA
           MOVE SVC-DATE TO CA-BUSINESS-DATE OF WS-PERM-CA
           MOVE SVC-TEXT-1 TO PK-PERMISSION
           IF SVC-TEXT-2 NOT = SPACES
               MOVE SVC-TEXT-2 TO PK-CHECK-USER
           END-IF
           CALL "PERMCHK" USING WS-PERM-CA
           MOVE PK-ALLOWED TO SVC-FLAG-1
           MOVE CA-RETURN-CODE OF WS-PERM-CA TO SVC-RC
           MOVE CA-REASON-CODE OF WS-PERM-CA TO SVC-REASON
           MOVE CA-MESSAGE OF WS-PERM-CA TO SVC-MESSAGE.
       1000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
      *> COM-025: A MISSING TUNING PARAMETER NEVER STOPS A BUSINESS
      *> ACTION - THE CALLER'S DEFAULT IS RETURNED WITH A WARNING.
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
       1100-PARM SECTION.
       1100-START.
           INITIALIZE WS-PARM-CA
           MOVE SVC-COMPANY TO CA-COMPANY OF WS-PARM-CA
           MOVE SVC-USER TO CA-USER OF WS-PARM-CA
           MOVE SVC-DATE TO CA-BUSINESS-DATE OF WS-PARM-CA
           MOVE SVC-TEXT-1 TO PM-PARAM-CODE
           MOVE SVC-DATE TO PM-AS-OF
           MOVE "Y" TO PM-USE-DEFAULT
           IF SVC-FUNC = "PARMNUM"
               MOVE "GETNUM" TO CA-FUNCTION OF WS-PARM-CA
               MOVE SVC-NUM-1 TO WS-WORK-NUM
               MOVE SPACES TO PM-DEFAULT-TEXT
               MOVE WS-WORK-NUM TO WS-NUM-EDIT
               MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-NUM-EDIT)
                   TO PM-DEFAULT-TEXT
           ELSE
               MOVE "GET" TO CA-FUNCTION OF WS-PARM-CA
               MOVE SVC-TEXT-2 TO PM-DEFAULT-TEXT
           END-IF
           CALL "PARMGET" USING WS-PARM-CA
           MOVE PM-VALUE-TEXT TO SVC-TEXT-OUT
           MOVE PM-VALUE-NUM TO SVC-NUM-OUT
           MOVE PM-FOUND TO SVC-FLAG-1
           MOVE CA-RETURN-CODE OF WS-PARM-CA TO SVC-RC
           MOVE CA-REASON-CODE OF WS-PARM-CA TO SVC-REASON
           IF SVC-RC > 4
               MOVE CA-MESSAGE OF WS-PARM-CA TO SVC-MESSAGE
           END-IF
           IF SVC-FUNC = "PARMNUM" AND PM-FOUND NOT = "Y"
               MOVE SVC-NUM-1 TO SVC-NUM-OUT
               MOVE 4 TO SVC-RC
           END-IF.
       1100-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
       1200-AUDIT SECTION.
       1200-START.
           INITIALIZE WS-AUD-CA
           MOVE "WRITE" TO CA-FUNCTION OF WS-AUD-CA
           MOVE SVC-COMPANY TO CA-COMPANY OF WS-AUD-CA
           MOVE SVC-SITE TO CA-SITE OF WS-AUD-CA
           MOVE SVC-USER TO CA-USER OF WS-AUD-CA
           MOVE SVC-DATE TO CA-BUSINESS-DATE OF WS-AUD-CA
           MOVE SVC-CORRELATION TO CA-CORRELATION-ID OF WS-AUD-CA
           MOVE SVC-AUD-ENTITY TO AU-ENTITY-TYPE
           MOVE SVC-AUD-KEY TO AU-ENTITY-KEY
           MOVE SVC-AUD-ACTION TO AU-ACTION
           MOVE SVC-AUD-FIELD TO AU-FIELD-NAME
           MOVE SVC-AUD-OLD TO AU-OLD-VALUE
           MOVE SVC-AUD-NEW TO AU-NEW-VALUE
           MOVE SVC-AUD-REASON TO AU-REASON
           MOVE SVC-AUD-AUTH TO AU-AUTHORITY-REF
           MOVE "COBOL" TO AU-SOURCE
           IF SVC-AUD-SENS = "Y"
               MOVE "Y" TO AU-SENSITIVE
           ELSE
               MOVE "N" TO AU-SENSITIVE
           END-IF
           CALL "AUDITLOG" USING WS-AUD-CA
           MOVE CA-RETURN-CODE OF WS-AUD-CA TO SVC-RC
           MOVE CA-REASON-CODE OF WS-AUD-CA TO SVC-REASON
           IF SVC-RC > 4
               MOVE CA-MESSAGE OF WS-AUD-CA TO SVC-MESSAGE
           END-IF.
       1200-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
      *> COM-017 / COM-022: SEVERITY DRIVES THE RETURN CODE AND AN
      *> EXCEPTION WITHOUT AN OWNER IS REFUSED.  THE PURCHASE LEDGER
      *> ALWAYS SUPPLIES THE AP OWNER OR THE PAYABLES ROLE.
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
       1300-EXCEPT SECTION.
       1300-START.
           INITIALIZE WS-EXC-CA
           MOVE "RAISE" TO CA-FUNCTION OF WS-EXC-CA
           MOVE SVC-COMPANY TO CA-COMPANY OF WS-EXC-CA
           MOVE SVC-SITE TO CA-SITE OF WS-EXC-CA
           MOVE SVC-USER TO CA-USER OF WS-EXC-CA
           MOVE SVC-DATE TO CA-BUSINESS-DATE OF WS-EXC-CA
           MOVE "AP" TO EX-MODULE
           MOVE SVC-EXC-SEVERITY TO EX-SEVERITY
           MOVE SVC-EXC-CATEGORY TO EX-CATEGORY
           MOVE SVC-EXC-DOCTYPE TO EX-DOCUMENT-TYPE
           MOVE SVC-EXC-DOCREF TO EX-DOCUMENT-REF
           MOVE SVC-EXC-MESSAGE TO EX-MESSAGE-TEXT
           MOVE SVC-EXC-AMOUNT TO EX-AMOUNT-GBP
           IF SVC-EXC-OWNER = SPACES AND SVC-EXC-ROLE = SPACES
               MOVE "APMGR" TO EX-OWNER-ROLE
           ELSE
               MOVE SVC-EXC-OWNER TO EX-OWNER-USER
               MOVE SVC-EXC-ROLE TO EX-OWNER-ROLE
           END-IF
           CALL "EXCPRAIS" USING WS-EXC-CA
           MOVE EX-EXCEPTION-ID TO SVC-EXC-ID
           MOVE CA-RETURN-CODE OF WS-EXC-CA TO SVC-RC
           MOVE CA-REASON-CODE OF WS-EXC-CA TO SVC-REASON
           MOVE CA-MESSAGE OF WS-EXC-CA TO SVC-MESSAGE.
       1300-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
       1400-NUMBER SECTION.
       1400-START.
           INITIALIZE WS-NUM-CA
           MOVE "NEXT" TO CA-FUNCTION OF WS-NUM-CA
           MOVE SVC-COMPANY TO CA-COMPANY OF WS-NUM-CA
           MOVE SVC-USER TO CA-USER OF WS-NUM-CA
           MOVE SVC-DATE TO CA-BUSINESS-DATE OF WS-NUM-CA
           MOVE SVC-CORRELATION TO CA-CORRELATION-ID OF WS-NUM-CA
           MOVE SVC-TEXT-1 TO NG-SERIES-CODE
           CALL "NUMGEN" USING WS-NUM-CA
           MOVE NG-DOCUMENT-NUMBER TO SVC-TEXT-OUT
           MOVE CA-RETURN-CODE OF WS-NUM-CA TO SVC-RC
           MOVE CA-REASON-CODE OF WS-NUM-CA TO SVC-REASON
           MOVE CA-MESSAGE OF WS-NUM-CA TO SVC-MESSAGE.
       1400-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
       1500-PERIOD SECTION.
       1500-START.
           INITIALIZE WS-PER-CA
           MOVE "CHECK" TO CA-FUNCTION OF WS-PER-CA
           MOVE SVC-COMPANY TO CA-COMPANY OF WS-PER-CA
           MOVE SVC-USER TO CA-USER OF WS-PER-CA
           MOVE SVC-DATE TO CA-BUSINESS-DATE OF WS-PER-CA
           MOVE SVC-DATE-1 TO PC-POSTING-DATE
           MOVE SVC-DATE-2 TO PC-DOCUMENT-DATE
           IF SVC-TEXT-1 = SPACES
               MOVE "POST" TO PC-ACTION
           ELSE
               MOVE SVC-TEXT-1 TO PC-ACTION
           END-IF
           CALL "PERIODCK" USING WS-PER-CA
           MOVE PC-FISCAL-YEAR TO SVC-INT-OUT
           MOVE PC-PERIOD-NO TO SVC-INT-OUT2
           MOVE PC-PERIOD-STATUS TO SVC-TEXT-OUT
           MOVE PC-ALLOWED TO SVC-FLAG-1
           MOVE CA-RETURN-CODE OF WS-PER-CA TO SVC-RC
           MOVE CA-REASON-CODE OF WS-PER-CA TO SVC-REASON
           MOVE CA-MESSAGE OF WS-PER-CA TO SVC-MESSAGE.
       1500-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
      *> TERMS DERIVES THE CONTRACTUAL DUE AND DISCOUNT DATES.  THE
      *> UNADJUSTED DUE DATE IS ALSO RETURNED SO THAT ANY BACS
      *> ADJUSTMENT STAYS VISIBLE (AP-009).
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
       1600-TERMS SECTION.
       1600-START.
           INITIALIZE WS-TRM-CA
           MOVE "DUEDATE" TO CA-FUNCTION OF WS-TRM-CA
           MOVE SVC-COMPANY TO CA-COMPANY OF WS-TRM-CA
           MOVE SVC-USER TO CA-USER OF WS-TRM-CA
           MOVE SVC-DATE TO CA-BUSINESS-DATE OF WS-TRM-CA
           MOVE SVC-TEXT-1 TO TC-TERMS-CODE
           MOVE SVC-DATE-1 TO TC-INVOICE-DATE
           IF SVC-DATE-2 NOT = 0
               MOVE SVC-DATE-2 TO TC-RECEIVED-DATE
               MOVE SVC-DATE-2 TO TC-SUPPLY-DATE
           END-IF
           MOVE SVC-NUM-1 TO TC-NET-AMOUNT
           MOVE SVC-NUM-2 TO TC-VAT-AMOUNT
           IF SVC-FLAG-1 = "Y"
               MOVE "Y" TO TC-BACS-ADJUST
               MOVE "BACK" TO TC-BACS-DIRECTION
           ELSE
               MOVE "N" TO TC-BACS-ADJUST
           END-IF
           IF SVC-TEXT-2 NOT = SPACES
               MOVE SVC-TEXT-2 TO TC-CALENDAR
           END-IF
           CALL "TERMCALC" USING WS-TRM-CA
           MOVE TC-DUE-DATE TO SVC-DATE-OUT
           MOVE TC-DISCOUNT-DATE TO SVC-DATE-OUT2
           MOVE TC-DISCOUNT-AMT TO SVC-NUM-OUT
           MOVE TC-DUE-DATE-RAW TO SVC-DATE-2
           MOVE TC-TERM-DAYS TO SVC-INT-OUT
           MOVE TC-MAX-TERM-DAYS TO SVC-INT-OUT2
           MOVE TC-SOURCE TO SVC-TEXT-OUT
           MOVE TC-LONG-TERM-FLAG TO SVC-FLAG-2
           MOVE CA-RETURN-CODE OF WS-TRM-CA TO SVC-RC
           MOVE CA-REASON-CODE OF WS-TRM-CA TO SVC-REASON
           MOVE CA-MESSAGE OF WS-TRM-CA TO SVC-MESSAGE.
       1600-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
      *> D-14: core.FxRate HOLDS FOREIGN UNITS PER ONE POUND STERLING.
      *> A MISSING OR ZERO RATE IS REFUSED, NEVER DEFAULTED TO ONE.
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
       1700-FXGBP SECTION.
       1700-START.
           INITIALIZE WS-FXC-CA
           MOVE "TOGBP" TO CA-FUNCTION OF WS-FXC-CA
           MOVE SVC-COMPANY TO CA-COMPANY OF WS-FXC-CA
           MOVE SVC-USER TO CA-USER OF WS-FXC-CA
           MOVE SVC-DATE TO CA-BUSINESS-DATE OF WS-FXC-CA
           MOVE SVC-TEXT-1 TO FX-CURRENCY
           MOVE SVC-DATE-1 TO FX-RATE-DATE
           MOVE "SPOT" TO FX-RATE-TYPE
           MOVE SVC-NUM-1 TO FX-FOREIGN-AMOUNT
           MOVE 2 TO FX-PLACES
           IF SVC-NUM-2 NOT = 0
               MOVE SVC-NUM-2 TO FX-RATE-ENTERED
           END-IF
           CALL "FXCONV" USING WS-FXC-CA
           MOVE FX-GBP-AMOUNT TO SVC-NUM-OUT
           MOVE FX-RATE TO SVC-NUM-OUT2
           MOVE CA-RETURN-CODE OF WS-FXC-CA TO SVC-RC
           MOVE CA-REASON-CODE OF WS-FXC-CA TO SVC-REASON
           MOVE CA-MESSAGE OF WS-FXC-CA TO SVC-MESSAGE.
       1700-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       1800-FXREAL SECTION.
       1800-START.
           INITIALIZE WS-FXC-CA
           MOVE "REALISED" TO CA-FUNCTION OF WS-FXC-CA
           MOVE SVC-COMPANY TO CA-COMPANY OF WS-FXC-CA
           MOVE SVC-USER TO CA-USER OF WS-FXC-CA
           MOVE SVC-DATE TO CA-BUSINESS-DATE OF WS-FXC-CA
           MOVE SVC-TEXT-1 TO FX-CURRENCY
           MOVE SVC-DATE-1 TO FX-RATE-DATE
           MOVE "SPOT" TO FX-RATE-TYPE
           MOVE SVC-NUM-1 TO FX-FOREIGN-AMOUNT
           MOVE SVC-NUM-2 TO FX-RATE
           MOVE SVC-NUM-3 TO FX-RATE-2
           MOVE 2 TO FX-PLACES
           MOVE "LIABILITY" TO FX-POSITION
           CALL "FXCONV" USING WS-FXC-CA
           MOVE FX-REALISED TO SVC-NUM-OUT
           MOVE FX-GBP-AMOUNT TO SVC-NUM-OUT2
           MOVE FX-GBP-AMOUNT-2 TO SVC-NUM-3
           MOVE CA-RETURN-CODE OF WS-FXC-CA TO SVC-RC
           MOVE CA-REASON-CODE OF WS-FXC-CA TO SVC-REASON
           MOVE CA-MESSAGE OF WS-FXC-CA TO SVC-MESSAGE.
       1800-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
      *> AP-004: NORMALISATION TRIMS OUTER SPACE, COLLAPSES RUNS OF
      *> INTERNAL SPACE AND IGNORES CASE.  IT DOES NOT REMOVE MEANINGFUL
      *> PUNCTUATION OR LEADING ZEROES.
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
       1900-NORMREF SECTION.
       1900-START.
           INITIALIZE WS-STR-CA
           MOVE "DOCREF" TO CA-FUNCTION OF WS-STR-CA
           MOVE SVC-COMPANY TO CA-COMPANY OF WS-STR-CA
           MOVE SVC-USER TO CA-USER OF WS-STR-CA
           MOVE SVC-DATE TO CA-BUSINESS-DATE OF WS-STR-CA
           MOVE SVC-TEXT-3 TO SU-TEXT-IN
           MOVE 40 TO SU-MAX-LEN
           CALL "STRUTIL" USING WS-STR-CA
           MOVE SU-TEXT-OUT TO SVC-TEXT-OUT
           MOVE SU-CHANGED TO SVC-FLAG-1
           MOVE SU-VALID TO SVC-FLAG-2
           MOVE CA-RETURN-CODE OF WS-STR-CA TO SVC-RC
           MOVE CA-REASON-CODE OF WS-STR-CA TO SVC-REASON
           IF SVC-RC > 4
               MOVE CA-MESSAGE OF WS-STR-CA TO SVC-MESSAGE
           END-IF
           IF SVC-RC = 4
               MOVE 0 TO SVC-RC
           END-IF.
       1900-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-ROUND SECTION.
       2000-START.
           INITIALIZE WS-RND-CA
           MOVE "ROUND" TO CA-FUNCTION OF WS-RND-CA
           MOVE SVC-COMPANY TO CA-COMPANY OF WS-RND-CA
           MOVE SVC-USER TO CA-USER OF WS-RND-CA
           MOVE SVC-DATE TO CA-BUSINESS-DATE OF WS-RND-CA
           MOVE SVC-NUM-1 TO RA-VALUE
           MOVE SVC-INT-1 TO RA-PLACES
           CALL "RNDALLOC" USING WS-RND-CA
           MOVE RA-RESULT TO SVC-NUM-OUT
           MOVE CA-RETURN-CODE OF WS-RND-CA TO SVC-RC
           MOVE CA-REASON-CODE OF WS-RND-CA TO SVC-REASON.
       2000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-DATES SECTION.
       2100-START.
           INITIALIZE WS-DAT-CA
           MOVE SVC-COMPANY TO CA-COMPANY OF WS-DAT-CA
           MOVE SVC-USER TO CA-USER OF WS-DAT-CA
           MOVE SVC-DATE TO CA-BUSINESS-DATE OF WS-DAT-CA
           MOVE SVC-DATE-1 TO DC-DATE-1
           MOVE SVC-DATE-2 TO DC-DATE-2
           MOVE SVC-INT-1 TO DC-NUMBER
           IF SVC-TEXT-1 = SPACES
               MOVE "ENG" TO DC-CALENDAR
           ELSE
               MOVE SVC-TEXT-1 TO DC-CALENDAR
           END-IF
           IF SVC-TEXT-2 = SPACES
               MOVE "NEXT" TO DC-DIRECTION
           ELSE
               MOVE SVC-TEXT-2 TO DC-DIRECTION
           END-IF
           EVALUATE SVC-FUNC
               WHEN "ADDDAYS"  MOVE "ADDDAYS" TO CA-FUNCTION
                                   OF WS-DAT-CA
               WHEN "DAYSBTWN" MOVE "DAYSBTWN" TO CA-FUNCTION
                                   OF WS-DAT-CA
               WHEN "BUSDAY"   MOVE "ISBUSDAY" TO CA-FUNCTION
                                   OF WS-DAT-CA
               WHEN "ADJUST"   MOVE "ADJUST" TO CA-FUNCTION
                                   OF WS-DAT-CA
               WHEN "ADDBUS"   MOVE "ADDBUS" TO CA-FUNCTION
                                   OF WS-DAT-CA
               WHEN "ADDMONTH" MOVE "ADDMONTH" TO CA-FUNCTION
                                   OF WS-DAT-CA
           END-EVALUATE
           CALL "DATECALC" USING WS-DAT-CA
           MOVE DC-RESULT-DATE TO SVC-DATE-OUT
           MOVE DC-RESULT-NUM TO SVC-INT-OUT
           MOVE DC-IS-BUSINESS TO SVC-FLAG-1
           MOVE DC-ADJUSTED TO SVC-FLAG-2
           MOVE DC-HOLIDAY-NAME TO SVC-TEXT-OUT
           MOVE CA-RETURN-CODE OF WS-DAT-CA TO SVC-RC
           MOVE CA-REASON-CODE OF WS-DAT-CA TO SVC-REASON
           IF SVC-RC > 4
               MOVE CA-MESSAGE OF WS-DAT-CA TO SVC-MESSAGE
           END-IF.
       2100-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
      *> COM-015: AN UNRESOLVED EARLIER ATTEMPT IS DELIBERATELY
      *> DISTINCT FROM A SUCCESS, SO THAT A PAYMENT IS NEVER REPEATED
      *> JUST BECAUSE THE PREVIOUS OUTCOME IS UNKNOWN.
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
       2200-IDEM SECTION.
       2200-START.
           INITIALIZE WS-IDM-CA
           MOVE SVC-COMPANY TO CA-COMPANY OF WS-IDM-CA
           MOVE SVC-USER TO CA-USER OF WS-IDM-CA
           MOVE SVC-DATE TO CA-BUSINESS-DATE OF WS-IDM-CA
           MOVE SVC-CORRELATION TO CA-CORRELATION-ID OF WS-IDM-CA
           MOVE SVC-TEXT-1 TO ID-OPERATION
           IF SVC-FUNC = "IDEMBEG"
               MOVE "BEGIN" TO CA-FUNCTION OF WS-IDM-CA
           ELSE
               MOVE "END" TO CA-FUNCTION OF WS-IDM-CA
               MOVE SVC-TEXT-2 TO ID-STATUS
               MOVE SVC-TEXT-3 TO ID-RESULT-MESSAGE
               MOVE SVC-TEXT-OUT TO ID-RESULT-REF
           END-IF
           CALL "IDEMPOT" USING WS-IDM-CA
           MOVE ID-OUTCOME TO SVC-TEXT-OUT
           MOVE ID-RESULT-REF TO SVC-TEXT-3
           MOVE CA-RETURN-CODE OF WS-IDM-CA TO SVC-RC
           MOVE CA-REASON-CODE OF WS-IDM-CA TO SVC-REASON
           MOVE CA-MESSAGE OF WS-IDM-CA TO SVC-MESSAGE.
       2200-EXIT.
           EXIT.
